  lines:
  - Welcome to Cliffbound! Your goal is to keep ascending the mountian. (Click to
    continue)
  - Use the WASD keys to move around and Spacebar to jump.
  - Make sure to follow the white rocks stay on the right path
  - When facing a wall left clicking will allow you to enter a climbing mode, then
    use your movement keys.
